{
  "appid": 2592160,
  "name": "Dispatch 超英派遣中心",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "《Dispatch》是一款超级英雄职场喜剧游戏，其中的故事发展将因你的选择而变化。你将管理一队由不合群的异类英雄所组成的功能失调团队，策略性地派遣不同的英雄到城市中各紧急事故现场处理事故，同时还要平衡办公室政治、人际关系，以及追寻你自己的英雄旅程。",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>数字豪华版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/38f617263bfd888a8cc9250e982a1657.avif?t=1784048711\" width=1560 height=2966 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《<strong><i>Dispatch</i></strong>》是一款超级英雄职场喜剧游戏，场景设定在现代的洛杉矶。它的编剧和导演的作品包括《<strong><i>Tales from the Borderlands</i></strong>》、《<strong><i>The Wolf Among Us</i></strong>》。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/08bd8194caff314b3877e8a53cb01029.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=676 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/08bd8194caff314b3877e8a53cb01029.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/08bd8194caff314b3877e8a53cb01029.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你将扮演罗伯特·罗伯逊（Robert Robertson），绰号机甲人（Mecha Man）。你的机甲服在一次与死敌的战斗中被摧毁了，不得已接受了超级英雄派遣中心的工作。这工作不是做英雄，而是担任派遣员。你的责任是改造、管理一群前超级壞蛋组成的团队，处理办公室关系，同时重建你的机甲服，为复仇做准备。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/586d83627f93a9724013ba68b1f8b71e.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=676 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/586d83627f93a9724013ba68b1f8b71e.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/586d83627f93a9724013ba68b1f8b71e.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/2f392a8c480bd1ae2342363aa9997653.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/2f392a8c480bd1ae2342363aa9997653.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/2f392a8c480bd1ae2342363aa9997653.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《<i>Dispatch</i>》中，你所做的每个决定都会影响故事的发展。从休息室里的玩笑到事故现场的生死攸关的情况，你的选择都会影响你与英雄们的关系及他们的忠诚度，以及你自己的故事的走向。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/dceb7af16b92e4c3117aafbaa9b7bb1e.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=676 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/dceb7af16b92e4c3117aafbaa9b7bb1e.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/dceb7af16b92e4c3117aafbaa9b7bb1e.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/b41e710d4ffd2988cf4b442825468221.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/b41e710d4ffd2988cf4b442825468221.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/b41e710d4ffd2988cf4b442825468221.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >使用战略地图查看正在發生中的紧急事故，并派遣合适（或不合适）的英雄来处理这些事故。在做战术决定时，要衡量风险与报酬，要知道每个选择都可能对你的团队和城市产生长期的后果。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/99ae1052cfeb656ae47aa0e2dc0dea5a.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=676 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/99ae1052cfeb656ae47aa0e2dc0dea5a.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/99ae1052cfeb656ae47aa0e2dc0dea5a.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/ef321860d8b0c1d8b02cbb91c12527e3.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/ef321860d8b0c1d8b02cbb91c12527e3.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/ef321860d8b0c1d8b02cbb91c12527e3.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >管理英雄有时不仅仅是考量他们的本领。每个英雄都有自己的怪癖、缺陷和包袱，你需要细腻地管理英雄們的差异，才能把团队凝聚在一起。你要提升他们的技能及启发他们的潜力，才能增强他们在紧急事故现场所展现的威力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《<i>Dispatch</i>》融合了故事、策略和幽默，它探索了英雄的真正意义：你可以是穿着披风的英雄，也可以是坐在办公桌后的英雄。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/95cbe9a2e0621fa0cf3fc2bbf49d68f7.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=676 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/95cbe9a2e0621fa0cf3fc2bbf49d68f7.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/95cbe9a2e0621fa0cf3fc2bbf49d68f7.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/c98ce3cbd204205ce440b9dc641176b6.poster.avif?t=1784048711\" width=676 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/c98ce3cbd204205ce440b9dc641176b6.webm?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/c98ce3cbd204205ce440b9dc641176b6.mp4?t=1784048711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/9f8915e3019e7b4bcab0dc59873cb9e6.avif?t=1784048711\" width=678 height=682 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >汇聚了来自娱乐各界的明星阵容</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aaron Paul（《Breaking Bad》，《Westworld》，《Black Mirror》）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laura Bailey（《The Legend of Vox Machina》，《The Last of Us II》，《Marvel's Spider-Man》）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erin Yvette（《Hades II》，《The Wolf Among Us》，《Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon》）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MoistCr1TiKaL（Charles White）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jacksepticeye（《Sonic Prime》，《River City Girls 1 &amp; 2》，《Bendy and the Ink Machine》）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travis Willingham（《The Legend of Vox Machina》，《Critical Role》，《Lego Avengers》）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alanah Pearce（《V/H/S Beyond》，《Cyberpunk 2077》，《Gears 5》）</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lance Cantstopolis</strong> (空手道，舞者，演员）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joel Haver</strong> (电影制作人、演员、YouTuber)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THOT SQUAD</strong> (作曲家：《Pound Cake》，《Hoes Depressed》)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yung Gravy</strong>（作曲家：《Betty（Get Money）》，《oops!》）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matthew Mercer</strong> (《Critical Role》，《Overwatch》，《Resident Evil 6》)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeffrey Wright</strong> （《American Fiction》，《The Batman》，《Casino Royale》）</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
